<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Westinghouse operation.</title>
<headline>EU clears Westinghouse operation.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday it had approved the acquisition by Westinghouse Electric Corp and Spanish company Equipos Nucleares of joint control of Westinghouse Technology services SA and ENWESA Operaciones SA.</p>
<p>&quot;Taking account of the position of the parties in the venture on the market it appears that the notified operation will have an extremely limited impact on competition in (Europe),&quot; the Commission said in a statement explaning its decision. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
